// Module Interface Metadata (`.axmi`) Binary Serializer, Fail-Closed Loader,
// Exported Symbol/Type/Trait/Capability/Const/Generic MIR Summaries,
// Source-Free `CompilerDB` Ingestion, and `inspect --axmi` / `--emit=axmi` (T765 / E18.4).
// Implements SPEC-24 sec.1-sec.2 & sec.4 (AXS-ART-001..005, AXS-ART-010..014, AXS-ART-050..053, INV-ART-001).
module compiler.artifact.axmi

